  Lines:
  - Yes...
  - She believed that as long as you stayed far away from her work, you would stay
    far away from the danger surrounding it.
  - She chose to carry that burden alone, rather than risk letting it reach you.
  ReplyOptions:
  - line: She really loves me.
    nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7f260a750da83a048b3244100e1193ef, type: 2}
    favorChange: 1
    requiredFavor: -10
    endDialogue: 0
    playerLine: "I'm feeling both happy and sad now. I\u2019m happy that my mom loves
      me so much. However, I\u2019m also sad because I may have misunderstood her
      all along \u2014 I've never even told her that I love her."
